        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"AB",
      "rhyme_vowel":"AB"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_1",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"I'm asinine, cat can rhyme with the acid lines",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"And if you haven't seen me spit, then your ass is blind",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm a mastermind, far more intelligent, I'm elegant",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Good penmanship and so excellent",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Exercise my mind, now I'm set to rise",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"Elevatin', levitatin' 'cause we mesmerized",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Simon said to rhyme, so I follow the leader",
          "rhyme":"9R",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And if you got a problem, you can swallow my sneakers",
          "rhyme":"9R",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"If you think I won't, you should know that I will",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"My words is hard to swallow like an oversized pill",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"You overdose, spit fire and now the microphone is toast",
          "rhyme":"ost",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"I'ma spit 'til every MCs' bones are broke",
          "rhyme":"ok",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"An overload of Post-It notes filled with quotes you spoke",
          "rhyme":"ok",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"You spit a line you wrote, I flip it back, okie-doke",
          "rhyme":"ok",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Acknowledge it, words hit you like a hollow-tip",
          "rhyme":"ip",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Haters mad when they see me spit, they gotta follow it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"What the problem is, homie? We can solve it quick",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"I spit that acid, know your flows dissolve in it",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"You'll get forgotten quick, another lost memory",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"You might be remembered as Easy Mac's enemy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"But ain't no one gon' remember your name",
          "rhyme":"am",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"I make it snow in April, in December, it rain",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"Mac's ferocious, and y'all is just atrocious",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"I'm supercalifragilisticexpialidocious",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"A funeral is at your back, so get your ass some roses",
          "rhyme":"oz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"I'm spittin' cancer at you cats and that's a diagnosis",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"I flow sick, leave you speechless like hypnosis",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"And lead your ass to the Promised Land like Moses",
          "rhyme":"oz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABBBCDEEFFGHHHIJKJLLMNOOPQQP",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABBBACDDAAEEEEAAAAAAFGHHEAAE"
    },
    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"chorus",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Easy Mac, faster rapper, master of the craft",
          "rhyme":"aft",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"It's disaster, passin' rappers, man, I had to laugh",
          "rhyme":"yg",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"I'm jabbin' cats, they gon' feel my punch",
          "rhyme":"$S",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Attackin' tracks, watch ya back or I'ma steal your lunch",
          "rhyme":"9ntS",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme":"ABCD",
      "rhyme_vowel":"ABCD"
