    {
      "section_id":"section_4",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Yo, yo",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"The prophecy set onto me, I'm the prodigy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"My mob is deep, and when you pray, then you talk to me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"I spit logically, words like Socrates",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Automatic with the flow like Bird when he shot a three",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"My rap profession and I'm pressin' for progression",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Why you stressin'? Explosive aggressive",
          "rhyme":"iv",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Messages I send, then I'ma bomb ya",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Monsters like Osama, it's karma",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"You imposters, beatin' me to prosper",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I ain't in school from 8 to 3, hooky like vacancy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"My legacy holds more power than the papacy",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"I'm hot like the place Satan be, cops hatin' me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"The federal agency got all they guns aimed at me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"And since the age of three, puffin' on the dankest tree",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"I'm makin' cheese, tell the hoes to get naked please",
          "rhyme":"iz",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"We in the world that's surrounded by water",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"Founded by fathers, surrounded by talkers",
          "rhyme":"ER",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"I'm the godfather on this mic, Corleone",
          "rhyme":"On",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"The king of Pittsburgh, so why don't you hop up out my throne?",
          "rhyme":"on",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Or I'll promise, family in black like they gothic",
          "rhyme":"ik",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"When I spit, your eyeballs pop right up out they sockets",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"I don't fuck with the justice, it doesn't exist",
          "rhyme":"ist",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"You talkin' shit just because you got nothin' to spit",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"I'm runnin' this shit",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"And in about twenty seconds you clowns will be steppin' from my presence",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
